<title>USA: DeKalb Genetics files for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>DeKalb Genetics files for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>DEKALB, Ill. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeKalb Genetics Corp said Monday it has filed an application to list its Class B Common Stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company expects trading on the NYSE to begin in June, 1997, under the symbol DKB, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
